WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.614 --> 00:00:16.606
Ethan couldn't believe how cold it was outside.

2
00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:25.334
At recess he wore a sweater, coat, scarf, hat, and mittens.

3
00:00:26.395 --> 00:00:27.576
But he was still cold!

4
00:00:36.132 --> 00:00:37.974
"Today's activity is outside!

5
00:00:38.894 --> 00:00:42.537
Bundle up," Miss Shelly said as Ethan walked in the door.

6
00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:45.220
"Outside?" Ethan asked.

7
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.261
"But it's freezing!"

8
00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:50.544
"It's fun," Bobby said.

9
00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:52.906
"You'll get used to it."

10
00:00:54.027 --> 00:00:55.588
Ethan didn't think it would be fun.

11
00:00:56.609 --> 00:00:58.370
But he zipped up his coat anyway.

12
00:01:00.552 --> 00:01:04.756
Outside, the ground was covered in snow from the snowstorm last night.

13
00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.042
Ethan walked carefully in his brand-new boots.

14
00:01:09.143 --> 00:01:10.924
He wasn't used to walking in the snow.

15
00:01:11.965 --> 00:01:13.366
He was afraid he'd slip.

16
00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.191
"What are we doing out here?"

17
00:01:19.592 --> 00:01:20.272
Ethan asked.

18
00:01:20.292 --> 00:01:23.675
"There are so many ways to play in the snow!"

19
00:01:24.135 --> 00:01:24.796
Nina said.

20
00:01:24.816 --> 00:01:29.800
"Today we're playing snowy tug-of-war," said their teacher.

21
00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.684
"Jason and Ethan, you're a team," Miss Shelly instructed.

22
00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:38.285
"Bobby, Nina, and Izzie, you're a team.

23
00:01:39.345 --> 00:01:42.266
Together choose a team name and a team color."

24
00:01:43.446 --> 00:01:45.547
Bobby groaned.

25
00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.147
"Why am I on the girls' team?"

26
00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:51.528
"Are you good at tug-of-war?"

27
00:01:51.908 --> 00:01:52.949
Ethan asked Jason.

28
00:01:54.029 --> 00:01:55.149
Jason shook his head.

29
00:01:55.169 --> 00:01:57.790
"I stink," he said.

30
00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:02.171
"Great. Let's be the Stinkers," Ethan said.

31
00:02:02.191 --> 00:02:05.576
"Ha-ha! Okay.

32
00:02:05.636 --> 00:02:08.078
And our team color will be green," said Jason.

33
00:02:08.098 --> 00:02:13.483
"Get ready to lose to the Purple Daisies," Izzie cried.

34
00:02:13.503 --> 00:02:17.306
"Prepare for the power of the Green Stinkers!"

35
00:02:17.807 --> 00:02:18.968
Jason shot back.

36
00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.071
Bobby shook his head.

37
00:02:23.091 --> 00:02:27.915
"I can't believe I'm on a team called the Purple Daisies."

38
00:02:32.879 --> 00:02:35.842
Daisies, draw your team line in the snow."

39
00:02:36.763 --> 00:02:40.045
Miss Shelly handed Nina a bottle filled with purple liquid.

40
00:02:40.065 --> 00:02:41.767
"What's this?"

41
00:02:42.327 --> 00:02:43.148
Nina asked.

42
00:02:44.429 --> 00:02:48.553
"Snow paint, which is food coloring mixed with water," she said.

43
00:02:48.573 --> 00:02:51.895
"Where do the team lines go?"

44
00:02:52.236 --> 00:02:52.976
Bobby asked.

45
00:02:54.057 --> 00:02:55.839
Miss Shelly held up a tape measure.

46
00:02:55.859 --> 00:03:01.263
"They should be two meters apart and two meters long," she said.

47
00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.821
Ethan and Nina drew their lines in the snow.

48
00:03:10.043 --> 00:03:11.323
is the center of the rope."

49
00:03:12.464 --> 00:03:15.065
Miss Shelly pointed to a flag tied to the rope.

50
00:03:15.085 --> 00:03:19.567
"The first team to pull the flag over their line wins.

51
00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:23.688
The only other rule is that no one can fall down!

52
00:03:24.769 --> 00:03:27.410
If anyone does, the other team wins!"

53
00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.291
Ethan looked down at his boots.

54
00:03:30.311 --> 00:03:32.152
"No one can fall?"

55
00:03:32.452 --> 00:03:33.633
he thought, worried.

56
00:03:33.653 --> 00:03:36.595
"Line up and get ready!"

57
00:03:37.015 --> 00:03:37.996
Miss Shelly called.

58
00:03:38.016 --> 00:03:42.500
"The strongest person goes in the back," Bobby said.

59
00:03:46.283 --> 00:03:46.803
can do it!"

60
00:03:47.203 --> 00:03:48.605
Ethan whispered to Jason.

61
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:51.487
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

62
00:03:51.507 --> 00:03:57.372
"Go!" Right away Ethan felt a strong tug.

63
00:03:58.453 --> 00:04:00.374
Ethan and Jason stumbled forward.

64
00:04:00.394 --> 00:04:03.792
"Oh, no you don't," Ethan grumbled.

65
00:04:05.173 --> 00:04:06.953
Ethan dug his boots into the snow.

66
00:04:08.054 --> 00:04:10.234
He squeezed his eyes shut and pulled hard.

67
00:04:11.214 --> 00:04:12.695
He and Jason stepped back.

68
00:04:13.815 --> 00:04:16.116
They were moving the flag toward their team line!

69
00:04:17.216 --> 00:04:18.156
He tugged harder.

70
00:04:19.157 --> 00:04:21.717
But then the Purple Daisies gave a huge tug!

71
00:04:23.638 --> 00:04:26.139
Ethan slipped and landed on his back in the snow.

72
00:04:26.159 --> 00:04:30.060
"Purple Daisies win!

73
00:04:30.944 --> 00:04:32.665
Green Stinkers lose!"

74
00:04:33.066 --> 00:04:33.886
Izzie shouted.

75
00:04:36.568 --> 00:04:37.429
Ethan laughed.

76
00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.991
Falling in the snow wasn't bad.

77
00:04:41.312 --> 00:04:42.053
It was fun!

78
00:04:42.953 --> 00:04:46.236
He stood up and yelled, "Let's play again!"
